   $q$A phone battery starts at 100 percent and drops 8 percent each hour, so $b = 100 - 8t$, where $t$ is hours. Which describes the key features of the graph?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Starts at $100$ on the $b$-axis, slope $-8$, reaches $0$ at $t = 12.5$","is_correct":true},{"text":"Starts at $100$ on the $b$-axis, slope $-8$, reaches $0$ at $t = 92$","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"subtracted-instead-of-divided"},{"text":"Starts at $-8$ on the $b$-axis, slope $100$, reaches $0$ at $t = 0.08$","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"swapped-slope-and-intercept"},{"text":"Starts at $100$ on the $b$-axis, slope $8$, reaches $0$ at $t = 12.5$","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"dropped-negative-sign-of-slope"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Starts at $100$ on the $b$-axis, slope $-8$, reaches $0$ at $t = 12.5$$q$, $q$When $t = 0$, $b = 100$, so the graph starts at $100$. The battery loses $8$ each hour, so the slope is $-8$. It reaches $0$ when $100 - 8t = 0$, so $t = \frac{100}{8} = 12.5$ hours. The value $t = 92$ comes from $100 - 8$, which is not how to solve the equation.$q$, 'draft', null)
